  "synopsis": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "It's the frantic final issue of the AVENGERS FOREVER adventure--that launches an all-new, ongoing series in November! It's the end of everything as the Avengers do battle with the Time- Keepers at the end of reality itself! Meanwhile, the Kang/Immortus war reaches a fever pitch that only one can survive! Literally all of Avengers' history and every Avenger who was or will be are affected by this climactic struggle!"
